    "description": "Geotourism valorizes special geological and landscape features. Geological hiking trails (Geo-trails), maps and guides are produced to make geology accessible to a broad audience. The Swiss Academy of Sciences (SCNAT) and “Erlebnis Geologie” have compiled a list of these trails.",
